-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Origin: Anicrop Studio
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sift started from Anicrop Studio (https://github.com/R4ksh4/AnicropStudio),
Copyright 2026 R4ksh4 and its contributors, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Sift is a rewrite of
that project in Rust and TypeScript: its features and approach to culling (eye
close-ups, camera AF areas for Canon, Sony and Nikon, in-file XMP ratings,
finding the RAW files that belong to a selection, side-by-side comparison,
composition guides, parameter frames) come from Anicrop Studio. Work derived
from it is distributed here under GPL-3.0-or-later, which the Apache License
2.0 permits.

